(egg, conditional on non-vegan version in method) 3
(vegetables, choice, examples sugar snap peas / chopped cabbage / sliced carrots / broccoli / cauliflower) as desired
(sauce) = (soy sauce) as needed -OR- (teriyaki sauce) as needed
