(tofu) <cut, cubes or slabs as preferred>
    <drain, carefully>
    + (sauce) <soak, a few minutes>
(coconut oil) <pour, copper wok, coat basin, ~1/2in at bottom>
    <heat, medium>
{stir fry} = (tofu) + (sauce) + (garlic) + (coconut oil)
{stir fry} <turn, and shift tofu, gradually increase heat until surface starts browning>
    + (vegetables) hard vegetables first <cook, until softened; reserve cabbage if using>
Optional [
    (egg) <scramble, separate smaller pan, if non-vegan, until no longer runny>
    {stir fry} + (egg)
]
{stir fry} + (vegetables, cabbage) if using <add, once eggs firm/brown to liking when eggs used>
    <cook, until cabbage softens, retain crunch>
    <remove from heat>
    <serve, plate, favourite sides>

